# Determinism is a requirement here, not a nicety: artifacts and generated forms
# are byte-reproducible for a fixed seed, and `core.autocrlf` must not be able to
# rewrite them on the way in or out.  Same pin as engine-rig's.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.dsl text eol=lf
*.lean text eol=lf
*.pddl text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
